Work in the existing project. Follow current user instructions and existing higher-priority repository guidance.
Read docs/v4-build/11-SYNC-CONTRACT.md and docs/v4-build/BUILD-STATE.md before a DAVG V4 task.
Use the active files identified there; old design masters and archived handoffs are historical references.
Preserve local work. Do not reset, switch projects or force-push.
Keep code, affected active specifications and BUILD-STATE updated together.
Distinguish proposed, documented, implemented, verified and deployed.
At handoff identify branch/commit or uncommitted state, changed paths, actual checks and remaining items.
The 25/75 service shell does not require every hub to use the same story.

